{"nodes": [{"id": "service_access_readme", "label": "Acc\u00e8s Projet + Service dans les widgets Grist", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "service_access_readme_regle_affectation", "label": "R\u00e8gle d'affectation Acc\u00e8sProjet = ProjectTeam \u222a Team.Projets_Access", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Deux sources d'affectation fusionn\u00e9es et d\u00e9dupliqu\u00e9es par NumeroProjet (identifiant canonique) ; les alias de nom d'un m\u00eame num\u00e9ro sont conserv\u00e9s pour reconna\u00eetre les tables historiques qui n'ont qu'un nom. Les anciennes colonnes Projets_Lecture_* ne donnent plus aucun droit.", "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "R\u00e8gle d'affectation", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "service_access_readme_rest_first", "label": "Chargement REST filtr\u00e9 avec repli fetchTable", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Demander au serveur uniquement les lignes du projet/service courant r\u00e9duit le transfert ; aucun filtre n'est invent\u00e9 pour une table sans colonne Service fiable, et toute r\u00e9ponse REST est re-filtr\u00e9e c\u00f4t\u00e9 client. Jeton getAccessToken({readOnly:true}) gard\u00e9 en m\u00e9moire, jamais stock\u00e9. Repli en cascade vers fetchTable() sans perte de fonctionnalit\u00e9 : REST est une optimisation, pas une fronti\u00e8re de s\u00e9curit\u00e9.", "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Chargement REST filtr\u00e9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "service_access_readme_etag_revalidation", "label": "Revalidation conditionnelle ETag / If-None-Match", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Chaque lot REST m\u00e9morise son ETag ; un 304 r\u00e9utilise les lignes d\u00e9tenues sans re-notifier les abonn\u00e9s, donc le co\u00fbt d'un rechargement cesse de d\u00e9pendre de la taille de la table. Le filtre faisant partie de l'URL, une modification sur un autre projet laisse la r\u00e9ponse inchang\u00e9e.", "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Revalidation conditionnelle", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "service_access_readme_localstorage_signal", "label": "Signal localStorage grist.service-context.data-changed", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Deux widgets c\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te sont deux iframes : apr\u00e8s chaque \u00e9criture, la liste des tables modifi\u00e9es est publi\u00e9e dans localStorage pour que les runtimes voisins invalident ces tables \u2014 le signal ne sort pas du navigateur et ne co\u00fbte rien au serveur. Ne couvre pas la modification d'un autre utilisateur.", "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Rafra\u00eechissement sans rechargement", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "service_access_readme_projectteam_name_resolution", "label": "R\u00e9solution heuristique ProjectTeam.Name \u2192 Team", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "ProjectTeam.Name est du texte libre : rapprochement en 4 \u00e9tapes (r\u00e9f\u00e9rence Grist, PrenomNom normalis\u00e9, Prenom+Nom, pr\u00e9nom seul si unique). Un nom ambigu ou inconnu ne donne jamais un acc\u00e8s arbitraire ; les lignes de m\u00eame nom complet sont fusionn\u00e9es (tous les emails re\u00e7oivent l'acc\u00e8s). Fragilit\u00e9 assum\u00e9e \u2014 l'\u00e9volution recommand\u00e9e est une r\u00e9f\u00e9rence stable.", "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "R\u00e9solution de ProjectTeam.Name", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "service_access_readme", "target": "service_access_widget_integration_audit", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Widgets couverts", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme", "target": "service_access_readme_regle_affectation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "R\u00e8gle d'affectation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme", "target": "service_access_readme_rest_first", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Chargement REST filtr\u00e9", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme", "target": "service_access_readme_etag_revalidation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Revalidation conditionnelle", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme", "target": "service_access_readme_localstorage_signal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Rafra\u00eechissement sans rechargement", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme", "target": "service_access_readme_projectteam_name_resolution", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "R\u00e9solution de ProjectTeam.Name", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme_regle_affectation", "target": "cahier_des_charges_dossier_source_analyse_team", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "R\u00e8gle d'affectation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme_regle_affectation", "target": "cahier_des_charges_dossier_source_analyse_projectteam", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "R\u00e8gle d'affectation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme_projectteam_name_resolution", "target": "cahier_des_charges_dossier_source_analyse_projectteam", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "R\u00e9solution de ProjectTeam.Name", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme_etag_revalidation", "target": "service_access_readme_rest_first", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Revalidation conditionnelle", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "cahier_des_charges_dossier_source_analyse_socle_shared", "target": "service_access_readme_rest_first", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Runtime partag\u00e9", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "service_access_readme_localstorage_signal", "target": "cahier_des_charges_dossier_source_analyse_colonnes_sync", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "les deux annoncent les tables modifi\u00e9es aux autres \u00e9crans \u2014 localStorage intra-poste vs colonnes-signal inter-postes", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "cahier_des_charges_dossier_source_analyse_gestion_acces_interservices", "target": "service_access_readme_regle_affectation", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/service-access/README.md", "source_location": "Widget d'administration", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "service_access_doc_set", "label": "Documentation service-a